OL,3,GNEWSAPM 'very supportive' of city mass
OL,4,Atransit system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister has said he is "very
OL,7,Fsupportive" of the idea of bringing a
OL,8,Fmass transit system to Bristol.
OL,10,FThe return of trams to the city has
OL,11,Fbeen a long debate over several
OL,12,Fdecades, halted multiple times by
OL,13,Fdisagreements over plans and a lack of
OL,14,Ffunding.
OL,16,FAndy Burnham acknowledged that the
OL,17,Fhighly sought-after infrastructure in
OL,18,Fthe city would cost billions but said
OL,19,Fhe thought there was an opportunity to
OL,20,Fwork alongside the Mayor of the West of
OL,21,FEngland Helen Godwin on the plans.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
