OL,3,GNEWSAPM 'very supportive' of city mass
OL,4,Atransit system
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm very committed to Bristol," he
OL,7,Fsaid. "I think it's a fantastic place
OL,8,Fand if we can bring forward together a
OL,9,Fvision for mass transit in Bristol, I
OL,10,Fthink it goes to the next level."
